{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27071","headline":"出关寄贾岛 · 周贺","name":"出关寄贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧乡无子孙，谁共老青门。\n迢递早秋路，别离深夜村。\n伊流偕行客，岳响答啼猿。\n去後期招隐，何当复此言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}